{"source":"Design record: hidden world, depth pass (11-04). Design only, not a runtime artifact.","scenario":"Two agents inspect the same sealed card through different permitted projections. This is a teaching illustration, not a sampled channel run.","truth":{"card":"R","history":"Modes<A,B,B>, Lamps<red,blue,red>"},"agents":[{"name":"Agent 1","probe":"?lamps{view}","reading":"Lamps<red,blue,red>","permission":"Read the lamp history only. Cannot call signal or inspect Truth.card."},{"name":"Agent 2","probe":"?modes{view}","reading":"Modes<A,B,B>","permission":"Read the selected modes only. Cannot inspect the card or another agent's probe."}],"definition":"obs ?lamps{view: ReceiverView} -> Lamps = project_lamps(view.history) L1","edited":"obs ?lamps{view: ReceiverView} -> Lamps = last_two_lamps(view.history) L1","scope":"illustrative certificate: exhaustive on all 2-card, 1-step histories; NOT a verified artifact","evidence":[{"method":"Exhaustive","scope":"All members of a declared finite domain, if every case was run. Outside that domain, no claim."},{"method":"Bounded","scope":"Every case within stated limits, such as history length at most 3; not every history."},{"method":"Seeded sample","scope":"A reproducible selected subset with a recorded seed. Not sufficient for promotion."}],"trace":{"definition":"apply(Base12<>, Patches</a:0->Q,/l:1->R>)","source":"Design record: versions world, depth pass (11-04). Illustrative local model."},"walkthrough":{"scope":"Design exercise, not a completed kernel run. Proposed finite contract: versions documents with 12 paths, 2 revisions and 2 patch steps. The judge checks the whole document and charged layer-0 calls; the learner sees only the declared read interface.","inventions":[{"kind":"object","declaration":"obj Revision = Quot[Pair<Doc, Int>, canon_revision] L1","check":"Validate the typed pair and a terminating canonicalizer; reject malformed documents.","call":"Construct Revision<Doc<12>, 2> and unfold its canonicalize